WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:09,000
This comparison makes it clear who is the real princess and who is the bumpkin.

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,640
It's good for the kids to go outside and play. It's okay if they get dirty.

3
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:16,560
Let’s take a shower together in a while

4
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:19,120
Jiaojiao, go and play with everyone.

5
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:23,200
Jiaojiao won’t go. Jiaojiao wants to stay with her grandparents.

6
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:27,200
We are filial

7
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:30,820
Old lady, Jiaojiao is such a filial child.

8
00:00:30,820 --> 00:00:34,420
Jiaojiao, this good child, will definitely be able to count on her when she grows up.

9
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:38,980
The two naughty eggs in our family are half charming and half sensible. I even burn incense for the Buddha.

10
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:42,830
The police uncle is here to pretend

11
00:00:42,830 --> 00:00:45,950
We are the Nancheng branch police dispatched to investigate a poisoning case.

12
00:00:45,950 --> 00:00:51,260
Will there be any more cases?

13
00:00:51,260 --> 00:00:55,060
Comrade policeman, how could our family be related to the poisoning case?

14
00:00:55,060 --> 00:00:57,860
We received a call from a child security guard that a poisoned stray cat was found.

15
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:02,340
Children, it can’t be Youyou, right?

16
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:04,900
What do you know about teasing a girl? Are you causing trouble like this?

17
00:01:04,900 --> 00:01:06,580
This is not a child meddling in other people's business

18
00:01:06,580 --> 00:01:08,660
But to ensure the life safety of every one of our citizens
